# @file Darley Arabian - Recruitment
# @author O口口口口口
# @author Katze (translator)
recruit:
  title: More Than Just... a Gaze
  lines:
    - The race footage was stripped of its cheering crowds, parade, and stage show.
    - The recorded minutes sped past until time resumed only in the final stretch.
    - At last, the view narrowed from more than a dozen racers to a single pair of feet, then zoomed in.
    - 「...A completely different running form again. The only thing they share is that incredible finishing kick...」
    -
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: ???
        - 「Because that is a young racer's instinct. How they apply force, the flexibility of their soles, their height, their weight... They cast every last part of themselves into the wind at the finish.」
    -
    - (Ah, which means...)
    - Without thinking, the voice beside the ear guided those thoughts to their conclusion.
    -
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: ???
        - 「Which means a trainer's work must come long before that moment.」
    -
    - A weight settled in.
    - The voice behind the ear, already so familiar to the body, became a tangible weight resting on the shoulder...
    - Turning was impossible. Warm breath against the nape sent a thrill through the body, locking every muscle rigid.
    - Still, it was red... At the very edge of vision, a lock of...
    -
    - color: %COLOR%
      content:
        - fontWeight: bold
          content: %CHARA%
        - 「We meet again, %CALLNAME%~」
    -
    - And just like that, the gaze drew everything in once more, feline, jewel-bright, unmistakably an Umamusume, and utterly divine...
